  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Vidyashree K</strong></p>\n<strong>Assistant Professor</strong>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Education Details</strong></p>\n\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n \t<li>M.Tech Computer Science &amp; Engineering, VTU, Belagavi.</li>\n \t<li>AMIETE, IETE New Delhi</li>\n</ul>\n<table width=\"689\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"122\">Email ID</td>\n<td width=\"567\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"mailto:Vidyashree26@gmail.com\">Vidyashree26@gmail.com</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LinkedIn ID</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/vidyashree-k-51a99639/\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/vidyashree-k-51a99639/</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Scholor  ID</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=hikAF3oAAAAJ\">https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=hikAF3oAAAAJ</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orcid ID</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://orchid.org/0000-0002-0716-9082\">https://orchid.org/0000-0002-0716-9082</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vidwaan ID</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://vidwan.inflibnet.ac.in/profile/294517\">https://vidwan.inflibnet.ac.in/profile/294517</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Professional Experience</strong></p>\n\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n \t<li>Industrial Experience – 9 years</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Publication Details</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>International Journals:</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vidyashree K, Dr.Thippeswamy K, published paper titled <strong>\"Ensemble Prediction Model On Cardio Vascular Disease\"</strong> in International Journal of Innovative Science and Research Technology(IJISRT)<em>,</em> 7, No. 8, (August 2022). ISSN No: - 2456-2165</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Professional body membership</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Life Member IETE</li>\n</ul>",
